<br>


<script type="text/javascript">
"use strict"
Number.prototype.pad = function(size) {
    var s = String(this);
    while (s.length < (size || 2)) {s = "0" + s;}
    return s;
};
function updateTimer() {
    var currentTime        = new Date().getTime() / 1000;
    var futureTime         = 0;
    var timeRemaining      = futureTime - currentTime;
    var minute             = 60;
    var hour               = 60 * 60;
    var day                = 60 * 60 * 24;
    var dayFloor           = Math.floor(timeRemaining / day);
    var hourFloor          = Math.floor((timeRemaining - dayFloor * day) / hour);
    var minuteFloor        = Math.floor((timeRemaining - dayFloor * day - hourFloor * hour) / minute);
    var secondFloor        = Math.floor((timeRemaining - dayFloor * day - hourFloor * hour - minuteFloor * minute));
    var countdownCompleted = "Completed";
    if (futureTime == 0) {
        $('#countdown').html("Star Fleet SOLD OUT<br>Contact Fish Tales at <a href='tel:+19569433185'>956-943-3185</a>");
    } else if (futureTime <= currentTime) {
        /* $('#countdown').html("To book <em>pre-launch</em> trips,<br>call or text 941-879-4240"); */
        document.getElementById("countdown").style.display = "none";
        document.getElementById("book-now-button").style.display = "inherit";
        /* document.getElementById("book-now-button-2").style.display = "inherit"; */
    } else if (futureTime > currentTime) {
        $('#countdown').html("Tickets Available In<br>T-" + dayFloor.pad() + ":" + hourFloor.pad() + ":" + minuteFloor.pad() + ":" + secondFloor.pad());
    }
};
var countdownTimer = setInterval(function(){ updateTimer(); }, 1000);
</script>


<img src="starship-ship-landing-vertical.jpg" alt="Close-up photo of the SpaceX Starship landing." style="margin-top: 55px; margin-right: 40px; margin-bottom:20px; float: left;">


## SpaceX Starship Flight 15 Ship Landing Viewing

**Price**: $69 per passenger<br>
**Dates**: Saturday November 14 at 3:15 PM CST<br>
**Key Times**: Checkin 1:15 PM | Boarding 1:45 PM | Departure 2:15 PM<br>
**Boarding Location**: _Double Sunshine & Diver 1_ [The Original Dolphin Watch, 33256 State Park Rd 100, South Padre Island, TX 78597](https://maps.app.goo.gl/S8dFn2MCT9JJMzZ48)<br>
_Osprey_: [Osprey Cruises, 501 E Maxan St, Port Isabel, TX 78578](https://maps.app.goo.gl/XUF23HMscQySLcsE8)<br>

* Ideal location to view the key events of the landing
* Have a clear view from the center of Starship's 270 deg turn on approach
* Around ≈4 miles / ≈6.5 km from landing pad
* Spectacular views of flip maneuver, landing burn, catch and pad
* Stable vessel, calm seas and open deck for excellent viewing
* Free parking, a guaranteed viewing spot and no need to show up many hours early
* If landing attempt aborted prior to checkin time, receive a full refund
<br>
<br>
**DELAY/SCRUB POLICY:** *Tickets are generally non-refundable.*<br>
Per agreement with our captains, if there is a launch delay, your tickets will still be valid for the new corresponding landing date and time.
Should you not be able to make the new date, you can either transfer your tickets to someone who can, or reach out to use by email at [FleetCommand@Star-Fleet.Tours](mailto:fleetcommand@star-fleet.tours) or phone at [941-879-4240](tel:+19418794240) to request a refund (at least 24 hours in advance of launch).
If the launch is successful but landing at Starbase is aborted, and the abort is annouced prior to the checkin time for landing, you will be fully refunded.
Should a Starbase landing abort be officially announced after that or if a passenger does not show up by the published boarding time, the boat will go out as scheduled to see the rocket on the pad, and tickets will be considered used and will no longer be refundable.
Conversely, in case there is an unexpected issue with the boat or weather keeping us from departing for the launch, and it occurs as scheduled, we'll issue you a full refund.
<br>
<br>

